# Test: explicit final decisions on received routes and API-originated wire routes.
# VALIDATES: spec-bgp-explicit-final-policy AC-1, AC-3, AC-4, AC-5, AC-6, AC-8.
# Eight numbered epochs: empty accept/reject, passing filter + reject,
# earlier reject + accept, delta accept/reject, real mixed-family raw accept/reject.
# The observer waits for the source receive counter AND quiesce before checking
# Adj-RIB-In. Every export refusal has a later permitted fence on the SAME TCP
# connection after restoring accept. No route-server is attached: restoration
# cannot replay API probes. Each epoch ends with acknowledged withdrawals before
# the next final-reject reload. Both sessions must keep their original connection.
# Runtime discrimination: force Policy.AcceptsAtEnd to true WITHOUT changing the
# new parser; the empty/passing/delta/raw reject assertions must fail at runtime.
option=timeout:value=180s

tmpfs=marker.txt:terminator=EOF_MARKER
received
EOF_MARKER

stdin=source:terminator=EOF_SOURCE
option=tcp_connections:value=1
option=linger:value=true
option=asn:value=65001
expect=bgp:conn=1:seq=1:hex=FFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF00170200000000
